  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It's very easy to hit the Open Hand gesture when using Index Controllers, simply don't touch anything on the controllers. Controllers such as Vive Wands ONLY have Explicit/Direct inputs to activate gestures. In order to achieve this behavior on other controllers, Left & Right Hand Skeleton must be set to`Unused`. This stops gestures from being triggered with poses but disables finger tracking.\n\n**Potential solutions?**\n\n- Disable Gestures via pose if `Gesture Wheel` is bound.\n\n- Disable pose emotes if no gesture activators are bound.\n\n- Menu toggle for gestures via hand pose?",
